---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Wild Landscape Co. is a Sunshine Coast garden design and landscaping team focused on outdoor spaces that fit how you live."
  path="/about"
>
  <section data-reveal class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold">About Wild Landscape Co.</h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-moss-600">
      We’re a Sunshine Coast–based team designing and building outdoor spaces
      that suit the way you live — for quiet mornings, long lunches, family
      time and everything in between.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 text-moss-600">
      From the first conversation through to planting and ongoing care, we
      bring design thinking and practical craftsmanship together to make each
      garden feel considered, enduring and easy to enjoy.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-10 border-l-2 border-moss-300 pl-5 text-lg text-moss-700">
      A good outdoor space should feel as natural to use as the rooms inside it.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
